    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy... like i'm just dragging this weight around for no reason. if everything is just destined to be nothing, then why is it considered so \"wrong\" to just want to get to the quiet part early? isn't there some kind of logic in just opting out of the friction?",
